    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do your dreams tell you?<br><br>The Silent Catalyst is a first-person psychological horror experience where every room is a puzzle and every puzzle is a piece of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play into the fragmented psyche of a mind on the edge. Each level unfolds a different psychological state, a phobia, or a scar from the past. Solve surreal, unnerving puzzles to progress, unlocking rooms that whisper memories, twist reality, and pull you deeper into something you're not sure you want to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no second chances. Once a room is completed, it's gone just like a dream you can't return to. Tools exist, but they're fleeting. Use what the environment gives you before it slips away. Narration, scattered clues, and distorted environments guide your descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This horror doesn't scream, it lingers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do your dreams tell you?<br><br>The Silent Catalyst is a first-person psychological horror experience where every room is a puzzle and every puzzle is a piece of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play into the fragmented psyche of a mind on the edge. Each level unfolds a different psychological state, a phobia, or a scar from the past. Solve surreal, unnerving puzzles to progress, unlocking rooms that whisper memories, twist reality, and pull you deeper into something you're not sure you want to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no second chances. Once a room is completed, it's gone just like a dream you can't return to. Tools exist, but they're fleeting. Use what the environment gives you before it slips away. Narration, scattered clues, and distorted environments guide your descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This horror doesn't scream, it lingers.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Silent Catalyst is a psychological horror where every room unlocks something. It's a compilation of puzzles that whisper and spaces that remember. Slow quiet dread, eerie comfort, and a story that watches you as closely as you watch it.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
